  "remediation": "Regenerate the artifact with integrity data enabled and commit the recorded digest or checksum. Specifically: fix a dependency that pins a classifier artifact.",
  "limitation": "It matches a dependency that pins a classifier artifact in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
